<title>UK: BOE allots 425 mln stg in repos.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 425 mln stg in repos.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said on Tuesday that it provided the UK money market with 425 million stg of assistance, all of it in repos to May 6 and 7.</p>
<p>The Bank forecast a money market shortage of 1.95 billion stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
